      "biography_summary_en": "The revision removes an overgeneralization about fine-grained features, distinguishes occurrence within an interval from simultaneity, and separates deduction from probabilistic evidence. Its contribution organizes and applies known distinctions; real observation methods and novelty are not validated.",
