        "bytes": 11441
      },
      "biography_summary_en": "Developed from idea I012, the sole tentative seed admitted from the 300-attempt search. The essay separates authentic participant judgment, evidential weight, and the institutional status of a selected final report. Fair sampling alone does not justify favoring a convenient later assembly. This is a limited insufficiency claim, not a ban on repeated consultation.",
